s, anger management, and domestic violence. Works in collaboration with counselors to help individuals reach their highest level of functioning. Priority is given to KDC health transfer members living on reserve, but also serves KDC members living off-reserve.","html":"Provides mental health and addiction prevention and support services. Services include screening and assessment, information and referral, treatment follow-up, drop-in support groups, community prevention, and celebrating sobriety events. Workshops, groups, and educational classes are offered on a variety of topics, including parenting, substance use, life skills, anger management, and domestic violence. Works in collaboration with counselors to help individuals reach their highest level of functioning. Priority is given to KDC health transfer members living on reserve, but also serves KDC members living off-reserve.","links":[],"images":[]},{"type":"h4","text":"Therapies","html":"Therapies","id":""},{"type":"ul","ordered":false,"items":[{"text":"Holistic Therapy","html":"Holistic Therapy","links":[]},{"text":"Evidence-Based Practices","html":"Evidence-Based Practices","links":[]},{"text":"Yoga & Meditation","html":"Yoga &amp; Meditation","links":[]},{"text":"Individual Therapy & Counseling","html":"Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Family Therapy & Counseling","html":"Family Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Group Therapy & Counseling","html":"Group Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Nutritional Counseling","html":"Nutritional Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Art & Nature Therapy","html":"Art &amp; Nature Therapy","links":[]}]}],"specialty_groups":[{"heading":"Specialties","items":["Substance Abuse Treatment"],"text":""},{"heading":"Amenities","items":["Substance Abuse Treatment"],"text":""}],"info_items":[],"faq_heading":"","faqs":[],"hours":{"heading":"","rows":[]},"tags":{"heading":"","items":[]},"sponsor":{"label":"Sponsored Ad","title":"Start Your Journey Now","text":"Are you or a loved one struggling with alcohol or drug addiction? Finding the right addiction treatment centre can make all the difference in achieving long-term recovery. That's why we've done the research for you and compiled a list of the best alcohol and drug addiction centres in Canada. Our list includes top-rated addiction treatment centres that provide evidence-based therapies, personalized treatment plans, and aftercare support services to help clients overcome addiction and maintain a healthy, fulfilling life in recovery. Whether you're looking for residential or outpatient treatment, we've got you covered. For immediate treatment help call: 1-855-885-4747","href":"tel:1-855-885-4747","image":{"src":"/assets/img/og/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.webp","alt":"addiction rehab centres","width":970,"height":920}}}}